      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "あたいの故郷の近くのダマセン岬に\n気性の荒い海獣どもの巣があるんだ。\nそこにいる海獣をみんなやっつけてきなよ。\nま、あんたたちじゃ、絶対無理だろうけどさ。",
        "official_en": "Right near my hometown, you'll find Cape Damasen,\nwhere there's a colony of aggressive sea beasts.\nNobody from my village will go near the place, so\nyou'd be doing them a favor if you finished 'em off.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
