      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "無理だと思ったのに……なかなかやるじゃん。\nこれで心配はなくなっちゃった。\nダーリン一筋なのは変わらないけど、特別に\nあんたの戦いにも、手を貸してあげる！",
        "official_en": "You got rid of those sea beasts? I didn't expect much,\nbut...you're pretty good, aren't you? My heart is\nSweetie's and only Sweetie's, but I'm happy to lend\nyou a hand in battle. You earned it!",
